  "details": "Users, specially with weak PC's, desperately need a button to unshow EVERYONE previously shown. Of course I could use Avatar-Culling, but this way I sadly can't watch other performers on events, that stand or perform farther away so I always need to manually show them.\n\nUsually they disappear and I often can't remember their names to search in the userlist to manually unshow them again.\n\nSo when I attend to another event, these performers often are attendees themselves but cuz I showed them, they stay shown -> I crash cuz of the amount of manually shown users.\n\nSo please, give us a button to unshow EVERYONE shown before.",
